This is the third bail application filed by the applicant under Section 439 of Cr.P.C./483 of B.N.S.S.
for grant of regular bail relating to Crime No.247/2024 registered at Police Station - Baikunthpur,
District Rewa (M.P.) for the offence punishable under Sections 363, 342 & 376 of IPC and Section 3/4 of POCSO Act.
